 "notes": "v6 (pulse-limited scoring, study/pulse_limited.py): v5 + strips 0.15 x 5.84 x 12.5 mm, hinge r 14.3 mm, cross 88 deg, compliant TPU clamp lip (BUILD.md 'best retune'). Robust-feasible on all NON-scaling checks (1P margin, stability, static, creep, geometry) at throttle {0.7,1.0,1.4} x J_hub {0.92,2.5,5.49}e-6. Robust cr_pl (min over throttle x J) = 0.0650. Tolerance at J_hub 2.5e-6: 9/9 (nominal + 8 random +-5 %), worst cr_pl 0.0859. FC/ESC PULSE SCHEDULE (set after measuring J_hub; interpolate in thrust; pulse scale is relative to op.pulse_capability_margin 0.95 of motor capability at that rpm; >1 x mod_frac_max is OK because the motor_torque_1p check on the delivered dQ (speed-locked gain < DC) is the true cap): T0.7 J9.2e-07: pulse x0.508 of the 0.95-capability pulse (= 0.483 x motor mod_frac_max), cr 0.3648 -> cr_pl 0.1854, binding fatigue_stress, 1P margin 0.184 | T0.7 J2.5e-06: pulse x0.781 of the 0.95-capability pulse (= 0.742 x motor mod_frac_max), cr 0.2373 -> cr_pl 0.1854, binding fatigue_stress, 1P margin 0.293 | T0.7 J5.49e-06: pulse x1.162 of the 0.95-capability pulse (= 1.104 x motor mod_frac_max), cr 0.1415 -> cr_pl 0.1645, binding motor_torque_1p, 1P margin 0.557 | T1 J9.2e-07: pulse x0.735 of the 0.95-capability pulse (= 0.698 x motor mod_frac_max), cr 0.1984 -> cr_pl 0.1458, binding fatigue_stress, 1P margin 0.233 | T1 J2.5e-06: pulse x1.066 of the 0.95-capability pulse (= 1.013 x motor mod_frac_max), cr 0.1367 -> cr_pl 0.1458, binding fatigue_stress, 1P margin 0.357 | T1 J5.49e-06: pulse x1.194 of the 0.95-capability pulse (= 1.135 x motor mod_frac_max), cr 0.0856 -> cr_pl 0.1023, binding motor_torque_1p, 1P margin 0.579 | T1.4 J9.2e-07: pulse x1.005 of the 0.95-capability pulse (= 0.955 x motor mod_frac_max), cr 0.1246 -> cr_pl 0.1252, binding fatigue_stress, 1P margin 0.215 | T1.4 J2.5e-06: pulse x1.232 of the 0.95-capability pulse (= 1.170 x motor mod_frac_max), cr 0.0850 -> cr_pl 0.1047, binding motor_torque_1p, 1P margin 0.304 | T1.4 J5.49e-06: pulse x1.232 of the 0.95-capability pulse (= 1.170 x motor mod_frac_max), cr 0.0528 -> cr_pl 0.0650, binding motor_torque_1p, 1P margin 0.306. The stored op pulse is the original; apply the schedule in flight. Fatigue binds at low J/low throttle, the motor 1P torque at high J/high throttle. | DE6 base: goodman"
